    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406-a1-a27">

                <pb facs="0662" n="592" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg592"/>

                <head>[Enclosure No. 31.—Telegram at 5 minutes past 10 at night.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Luis PotOsi,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 18, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To Baron <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. V. Magnus,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., Queretaro:</hi></p>
                <p>I regret to inform you, in answer to the telegram you have been pleased to send
                    me this night, that, as I announced to you the day before yesterday at this
                    city, the President of the republic deems it impossible to grant the pardon of
                    the Archduke Maximilian, upon the gravest considerations of justice, and the
                    necessity for securing the peace of the republic.</p>
                <p>I am, baron, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
